@api = http://localhost:5242/api

### Health
GET http://localhost:5242/health/ready

### Public campaigns
GET {{api}}/campaigns?page=1&pageSize=20

### Login — replace credentials with a verified account
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "VoucherHub@123"
}

### Redeem — replace offer ID, JWT and key with real values
POST {{api}}/voucher-offers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/redeem
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

